    "Tokens",
    "Copies"
  ],
  "strategy": "Saheeli, Radiant Creator gives you energy whenever you cast an Artificer or artifact spell, and at the start of combat spends three of it on a hasty 5/5 artifact copy of a permanent you control, sacrificed at the next end step. Aether Hub, Servant of the Conduit, Rogue Refiner, Attune with Aether, Glimmer of Genius and Whirler Virtuoso keep the meter full, while Aethertide Whale, Aetherwind Basker, Peema Trailblazer, Lightning Runner and Architect of the Untamed spend it on bounce, pumps, extra combats and 6/6 Beasts. Aetherworks Marvel and Aetherflux Conduit turn a big reserve into free spells, and Aetheric Amplifier doubles every kind of counter you have. Sai, Master Thopterist, Whirler Rogue, Pia and Kiran Nalaar, Thopter Spy Network and Retrofitter Foundry fill the air with Thopters that Stridehangar Automaton grows and adds to, Panharmonicon doubles every enters trigger, Triplicate Titan leaves three Golems behind, and Reckless Fireweaver pings the table for each artifact that enters. Confiscation Coup, Duplicant, Chaos Warp, Reality Shift and Disallow answer what matters, Arcane Denial protects the board, and Blasphemous Act resets one the artifacts can rebuild.",
